Created by PLY version 3.11 (http://www.dabeaz.com/ply)

Unused terminals:

    EQ
    GE
    GT
    LE
    LT
    NE

Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> lines
Rule 2     lines -> empty
Rule 3     lines -> lines NEWLINE
Rule 4     lines -> lines statement NEWLINE
Rule 5     empty -> <empty>
Rule 6     statement -> NAME EQUALS expression
Rule 7     statement -> PRINT LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 8     expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 9     expression -> expression MINUS expression
Rule 10    expression -> expression TIMES expression
Rule 11    expression -> expression DIVIDE expression
Rule 12    expression -> MINUS expression
Rule 13    expression -> NUMBER
Rule 14    expression -> STRING
Rule 15    expression -> NAME
Rule 16    expression -> TRUE
Rule 17    expression -> FALSE
Rule 18    expression -> LPAREN expression RPAREN

Terminals, with rules where they appear

DIVIDE               : 11
EQ                   : 
EQUALS               : 6
FALSE                : 17
GE                   : 
GT                   : 
LE                   : 
LPAREN               : 7 18
LT                   : 
MINUS                : 9 12
NAME                 : 6 15
NE                   : 
NEWLINE              : 3 4
NUMBER               : 13
PLUS                 : 8
PRINT                : 7
RPAREN               : 7 18
STRING               : 14
TIMES                : 10
TRUE                 : 16
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

empty                : 2
expression           : 6 7 8 8 9 9 10 10 11 11 12 18
lines                : 1 3 4
program              : 0
statement            : 4

Parsing method: LALR

